{
  "chart": {
    "$description": "Chart colours (rule 50), every one an OKLCH value written out, so a phone app and a design tool read the same numbers. The series come in a fixed order: the eight accent hues, alternating warm and cool, on lightness steps chosen so any two stay apart for people with protanopia, deuteranopia or tritanopia, and each reaches 3:1 on a card and the page. Their chroma is the most sRGB holds at that lightness, up to 0.14.",
    "$extensions": {
      "org.glimstone": {
        "selector": ":root,\n[data-theme]",
        "theme": true
      }
    },
